OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Siege of the Deep
Description	Three rival keepers, and a vault of heroes in the middle that does not care which of you it reaches first. Skirmish, 3 opponents plus heroes. A hero company holds a walled keep in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

